{
  "description": "Per-group Bayesian-optimization winners. The global configuration in duplimend_global.json is the median/mode across these four. Reported results use the GLOBAL configuration; these are provided so the optimization stage itself can be audited.",
  "protocol": {
    "sampler": "optuna TPE",
    "optimization_seed": 42,
    "total_trials": 400,
    "objective_note": "Groups with ground-truth labels were optimized on ARI; real-life groups without duplicate-label ground truth were optimized on the Silhouette score."
